=== A. how far nprobe alone gets us (nlist=1024, so 1024 probes every list) ===
    If recall reaches 0.98 here the ceiling is IVF pruning; if it stalls
    near 0.96 the 96 B code is the limit and no amount of probing helps.
variant     nprobe    recall       QPS
v22 kl4        128    0.9452     47389
v22 kl4        256    0.9508     26112
v22 kl4        512    0.9524     12111
v22 kl4       1024    0.9528      4642

=== B. per-thread truncation: K_LOCAL keeps K_LOCAL*BLOCK of the candidates ===
    K_LOCAL=8 needs 73 KB of scratch beside the 48 KB table, so it only
    fits at BLOCK<=512; 16 only at BLOCK<=256. Blank rows are that limit.
